{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50702","headline":"寓居临平山下三首 其二 · 张祜","name":"寓居临平山下三首 其二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一角横查碍小滩，渔舟稍稍避回湍。\n鹿蹄踏叶暮山响，龟殻曝沙春水寒。\n诗句近吟知律变，《易》书穷讨觉才难。\n风光好处自擕酌，归去醉扶花药栏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50702.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50702","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}